[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099246457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4099246457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4099246457,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70VYl5","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T15:59:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T15:59:48Z","body":"I've removed the cherrypick label from this PR because, although this is objectively a bug, this is not a critical issue. Importantly, projects that have been built with an older version of Godot have had their visuals fine-tuned for the existing behaviour and should not have these visuals change with a patch release.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099246457/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099717660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4099717660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4099717660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70XLoc","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-20T17:20:43Z","updated_at":"2026-03-20T17:20:43Z","body":"Here's a test project that demonstrates the issue this PR fixes:\r\n[incorrect-reflection-colour.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26147230/incorrect-reflection-colour.zip)\r\n\r\nIn this MRP, the Environment is configured as follows:\r\n- Background Mode: Custom Color (purple)\r\n- Ambient Light Source: Custom Color (green)\r\n- Reflected Light Source: Background\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84679035-1032-4916-ae01-736d93399595\" />\r\n\r\nHere's some screenshots of this PR's current state:\r\n\r\nRenderer | HDR 2D disabled | HDR 2D enabled\r\n--|--|--\r\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/955ac61e-3ce6-4ab3-925d-2ea6c0956f2d\" /> | <img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bffe2875-8718-49f5-a6bc-133493a6f89b\" />\r\nMobile| <img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/829bbc11-03e1-4d9d-a412-04c1ea722162\" />|<img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/68941092-f40f-4556-bb9f-15382d3a3d7a\" />\r\nForward+ |<img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2596e54e-6530-46e6-8054-bd86c493f90b\" />|<img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de138136-0302-4d60-84c6-a75ff57cf022\" />\r\n\r\nI think that the Forward+ behaviour is the correct behaviour?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4099717660/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101658722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4101658722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4101658722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc70elhi","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-21T00:48:59Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T00:49:24Z","body":"> I think that the Forward+ behaviour is the correct behaviour?\r\n\r\nYes, I'm not sure where the reflection color discrepancy is coming from in Mobile/Compatibility. It seems fine in my testing project.\r\n\r\nIf you want to double-check this is correct behavior, use a PanoramaSkyMaterial with a plain color texture (GradientTexture2D with only one stop).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4101658722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120476453","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4120476453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4120476453,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71mXsl","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T18:26:52Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T18:26:52Z","body":"> If you want to double-check this is correct behavior, use a PanoramaSkyMaterial with a plain color texture (GradientTexture2D with only one stop).\r\n\r\nDouble checked as suggested:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"247\" height=\"988\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/204e66ff-fe31-48b4-8e8f-67be3ecbeaf7\" />\r\n\r\nRenderer | HDR 2D disabled\r\n--|--\r\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0eb9a2a-83de-467c-964a-79ddc1597616\" />\r\nMobile| <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbd318f7-3275-4942-8996-a2e371a3dc4a\" />\r\nForward+ |<img width=\"1100\" height=\"619\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e9335c0-f3a0-45b2-8829-830d10fe0936\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4120476453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122110065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4122110065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4122110065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71smhx","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-24T23:36:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-24T23:38:00Z","body":"Correct me if I'm wrong, but it looks like it's a general rendering issue in Mobile and Compatibility then, not something specific to this fix. This is possibly due to Mobile using an exposure multiplier to create its dynamic range of `2.0`. I don't know what would cause this in Compatibility though.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122110065/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122349401","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4122349401","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4122349401,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71tg9Z","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T00:35:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T00:35:35Z","body":"> Correct me if I'm wrong, but it looks like it's a general rendering issue in Mobile and Compatibility then, not something specific to this fix. This is possibly due to Mobile using an exposure multiplier to create its dynamic range of `2.0`. I don't know what would cause this in Compatibility though.\r\n\r\nAlso, the luminance multiplier only applies to Mobile when HDR 2D is disabled, but the problem also happens when HDR 2D is enabled.\r\n\r\nI can give this a deeper look sometime this week. Even if the fix for this bug doesn’t belong in this PR, I think it would be good to at least know what the cause of the bug is… 🤔","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122349401/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4127692226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112178#issuecomment-4127692226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112178","id":4127692226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72B5XC","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravat